%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 2d6a7fd86913b514e82373a096f27bd2, type: 3}
  m_Name: ConiousInto
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueScripts.DialogueSO
  lines:
  - talksprite: {fileID: -590802194, guid: 56980f1fbc24f5b4abcd0c44e5ce284e, type: 3}
    displayName: 'Traffic Conius:'
    textDelay: 0
    text: So let me get this straight.
  - talksprite: {fileID: -590802194, guid: 56980f1fbc24f5b4abcd0c44e5ce284e, type: 3}
    displayName: 'Traffic Conius:'
    textDelay: 0
    text: Your plan to get my job back is to become the strongest cardomancer in
      the city, travel to the Capital, and *beat up the CEO*.
  - talksprite: {fileID: 0}
    displayName: wHackwiz
    textDelay: 0
    text: ' ...'
  - talksprite: {fileID: 0}
    displayName: wHackwiz
    textDelay: 0
    text: "\U0001F44D"
  - talksprite: {fileID: -590802194, guid: 56980f1fbc24f5b4abcd0c44e5ce284e, type: 3}
    displayName: 'Traffic Conius:'
    textDelay: 0
    text: ...
  - talksprite: {fileID: -590802194, guid: 56980f1fbc24f5b4abcd0c44e5ce284e, type: 3}
    displayName: 'Traffic Conius:'
    textDelay: 0
    text: Well, nothing else has worked so far.
  - talksprite: {fileID: -590802194, guid: 56980f1fbc24f5b4abcd0c44e5ce284e, type: 3}
    displayName: 'Traffic Conius:'
    textDelay: 0
    text: And I do have some issues with how the company has been run as of late.
  - talksprite: {fileID: -590802194, guid: 56980f1fbc24f5b4abcd0c44e5ce284e, type: 3}
    displayName: 'Traffic Conius:'
    textDelay: 0
    text: And I was fired unfairly... A 7 minute bathroom break is NOT a terminable
      offense, no matter how much they want it to
  - talksprite: {fileID: -590802194, guid: 56980f1fbc24f5b4abcd0c44e5ce284e, type: 3}
    displayName: 'Traffic Conius:'
    textDelay: 0
    text: sigh... I guess it's alright.
  - talksprite: {fileID: 0}
    displayName: Hackwiz
    textDelay: 0
    text: "\U0001F4A5\U0001F4AA\U0001F525\U0001F4AF\r\n"
  - talksprite: {fileID: -590802194, guid: 56980f1fbc24f5b4abcd0c44e5ce284e, type: 3}
    displayName: 'Traffic Conius:'
    textDelay: 0
    text: 'BUT IT AIN''T GONNA BE EASY!!

'
  - talksprite: {fileID: -590802194, guid: 56980f1fbc24f5b4abcd0c44e5ce284e, type: 3}
    displayName: 'Traffic Conius:'
    textDelay: 0
    text: 'If you wanna go on a real quest, you''re gonna have to be responsible
      for yourself.

      Starting by getting a PROPER deck.'
  - talksprite: {fileID: 0}
    displayName: 'Hackwiz:'
    textDelay: 0
    text: "\U0001F480\r\n"
  - talksprite: {fileID: -590802194, guid: 56980f1fbc24f5b4abcd0c44e5ce284e, type: 3}
    displayName: 'Traffic Conius:'
    textDelay: 0
    text: 'Don''t look at me like that! Any self respecting wizard needs to start
      with a solid, basic deck. None of that fancy hackery.   '
  - talksprite: {fileID: -590802194, guid: 56980f1fbc24f5b4abcd0c44e5ce284e, type: 3}
    displayName: 'Traffic Conius:'
    textDelay: 0
    text: 'You have to learn the basics if you really want to become the greatest
      wizard.  Here''s some cards to start you off. '
  startsBattle: 0
  textColorDefault: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
  textBackgroundColorDefault: {r: 0.827451, g: 0.8352941, b: 0.5568628, a: 1}
  titleBackgroundColorDefault: {r: 0.6509804, g: 0.6509804, b: 0.6509804, a: 1}
  titleTextColorDefault: {r: 0, g: 0, b: 0, a: 1}
  spriteColorDefault: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  spriteBorderColorDefault: {r: 0.7137255, g: 0.72156864, b: 0.47843137, a: 1}
